│                          │ and vectorized), (3) polish the best candidate with a short coordinate-perturbation local │
│                          │ search and small-scale multi-start restarts. This changes data flow from stochastic       │
│                          │ single-point moves to full-batch gradient ascent with a structured restart pool, giving   │
│                          │ faster and more reliable convergence toward the optimal 14-point ratio.                   │
