│                          │ extra points along different axes (z, x, y) of the icosahedron, since the                 │
│                          │ icosahedron+poles family is the most promising basin. Keep trial count at 10 to avoid     │
│                          │ increasing the already-high eval time; the polish is fast because it involves only a few  │
│                          │ active pairs.                                                                             │
