│                          │ 6 L-BFGS-B stages of 200 iterations each with annealed sharpness, then SLSQP max-min      │
│                          │ polishing (t ≤ d² ≤ 1) on the top 8 candidates with random restarts. Fixed seed 42, total │
│                          │ runtime ~2–4s. This should push the squared ratio slightly above the 1/4.165849767        │
│                          │ reference.                                                                                │
